#: src/mailman/bin/master.py:570
msgid ""
"    Master subprocess watcher.\n"
"\n"
"    Start and watch the configured runners, ensuring that they stay alive and\n"
"    kicking.  Each runner is forked and exec'd in turn, with the master waiting\n"
"    on their process ids.  When it detects a child runner has exited, it may\n"
"    restart it.\n"
"\n"
"    The runners respond to SIGINT, SIGTERM, SIGUSR1 and SIGHUP.  SIGINT,\n"
"    SIGTERM and SIGUSR1 all cause a runner to exit cleanly.  The master will\n"
"    restart runners that have exited due to a SIGUSR1 or some kind of other\n"
"    exit condition (say because of an uncaught exception).  SIGHUP causes the\n"
"    master and the runners to close their log files, and reopen then upon the\n"
"    next printed message.\n"
"\n"
"    The master also responds to SIGINT, SIGTERM, SIGUSR1 and SIGHUP, which it\n"
"    simply passes on to the runners.  Note that the master will close and\n"
"    reopen its own log files on receipt of a SIGHUP.  The master also leaves\n"
"    its own process id in the file specified in the configuration file but you\n"
"    normally don't need to use this PID directly."
msgstr ""
"    Pengawas subproses master.\n"
"\n"
"    Mulai dan awasi runner yang dikonfigurasi, memastikan bahwa mereka tetap "
"hidup\n"
"    dan berjalan. Setiap runner di-fork dan di-exec secara bergiliran, "
"dengan master menunggu\n"
"    pada ID proses mereka. Ketika mendeteksi runner anak telah keluar, "
"master dapat\n"
"    memulainya kembali.\n"
"\n"
"    Runner merespons SIGINT, SIGTERM, SIGUSR1, dan SIGHUP. SIGINT,\n"
"    SIGTERM, dan SIGUSR1 semuanya menyebabkan runner keluar dengan bersih. "
"Master akan\n"
"    memulai kembali runner yang keluar karena SIGUSR1 atau kondisi keluar "
"lainnya\n"
"    (misalnya karena pengecualian yang tidak tertangani). SIGHUP "
"menyebabkan\n"
"    master dan runner menutup file log mereka, lalu membukanya kembali saat\n"
"    pesan berikutnya dicetak.\n"
"\n"
"    Master juga merespons SIGINT, SIGTERM, SIGUSR1, dan SIGHUP, yang\n"
"    hanya diteruskan ke runner. Perhatikan bahwa master akan menutup dan\n"
"    membuka kembali file lognya sendiri saat menerima SIGHUP. Master juga "
"meninggalkan\n"
"    ID prosesnya sendiri di file yang ditentukan dalam file konfigurasi, "
"tetapi Anda\n"
"    biasanya tidak perlu menggunakan PID ini secara langsung."

#: src/mailman/bin/master.py:601
msgid ""
"    Don't restart the runners when they exit because of an error or a SIGUSR1.\n"
"    Use this only for debugging."
msgstr ""
"    Jangan mulai ulang runner saat mereka keluar karena kesalahan atau "
"SIGUSR1.\n"
"    Gunakan ini hanya untuk debugging."

#: src/mailman/bin/master.py:607
msgid ""
"    If the master watcher finds an existing master lock, it will normally exit\n"
"    with an error message.  With this option,the master will perform an extra\n"
"    level of checking.  If a process matching the host/pid described in the\n"
"    lock file is running, the master will still exit, requiring you to manually\n"
"    clean up the lock.  But if no matching process is found, the master will\n"
"    remove the apparently stale lock and make another attempt to claim the\n"
"    master lock."
msgstr ""
"    Jika pengawas master menemukan kunci master yang sudah ada, biasanya ia "
"akan keluar\n"
"    dengan pesan kesalahan. Dengan opsi ini, master akan melakukan tingkat "
"pemeriksaan\n"
"    tambahan. Jika proses yang cocok dengan host/pid yang dijelaskan dalam\n"
"    file kunci sedang berjalan, master tetap akan keluar, sehingga Anda "
"harus secara manual\n"
"    membersihkan kunci tersebut. Namun jika tidak ditemukan proses yang "
"cocok, master akan\n"
"    menghapus kunci yang tampaknya sudah usang tersebut dan mencoba lagi "
"untuk memperoleh\n"
"    kunci master."

#: src/mailman/bin/master.py:620
