#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:147
msgid ""
"This script provides you with a general framework for interacting with a\n"
"mailing list."
msgstr ""
"Skrip ini memberi Anda kerangka kerja umum untuk berinteraksi dengan sebuah\n"
"milis."

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:151
msgid ""
"There are two ways to use this script: interactively or programmatically.\n"
"Using it interactively allows you to play with, examine and modify a mailing\n"
"list from Python's interactive interpreter.  When running interactively, the\n"
"variable 'm' will be available in the global namespace.  It will reference the\n"
"mailing list object."
msgstr ""
"Ada dua cara untuk menggunakan skrip ini: secara interaktif atau secara "
"terprogram.\n"
"Menggunakannya secara interaktif memungkinkan Anda bermain dengan, "
"memeriksa, dan memodifikasi sebuah milis\n"
"dari interpreter interaktif Python. Saat dijalankan secara interaktif, "
"variabel\n"
"'m' akan tersedia di namespace global. Variabel itu akan mereferensikan\n"
"objek milis."

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:158
msgid ""
"Programmatically, you can write a function to operate on a mailing list, and\n"
"this script will take care of the housekeeping (see below for examples).  In\n"
"that case, the general usage syntax is:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist [options] -l listspec [args ...]\n"
"\n"
"where `listspec` is either the posting address of the mailing list\n"
"(e.g. ant@example.com), or the List-ID (e.g. ant.example.com)."
msgstr ""
"Secara terprogram, Anda dapat menulis sebuah fungsi untuk mengoperasikan "
"sebuah milis, dan\n"
"skrip ini akan mengurus pekerjaan pendukungnya (lihat di bawah untuk contoh)"
". Dalam\n"
"hal itu, sintaks penggunaan umumnya adalah:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist [options] -l listspec [args ...]\n"
"\n"
"di mana `listspec` adalah alamat posting milis\n"
"(misalnya ant@example.com), atau List-ID (misalnya ant.example.com)."

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:168
msgid ""
"Here's an example of how to use the --run option.  Say you have a file in the\n"
"Mailman installation directory called 'listaddr.py', with the following two\n"
"functions:\n"
"\n"
"def listaddr(mlist):\n"
"    print(mlist.posting_address)\n"
"\n"
"def requestaddr(mlist):\n"
"    print(mlist.request_address)\n"
"\n"
"Run methods take at least one argument, the mailing list object to operate\n"
"on.  Any additional arguments given on the command line are passed as\n"
"positional arguments to the callable.\n"
"\n"
"If -l is not given then you can run a function that takes no arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut adalah contoh cara menggunakan opsi --run. Misalkan Anda memiliki "
"file di\n"
"direktori instalasi Mailman bernama 'listaddr.py', dengan dua fungsi "
"berikut:\n"
"\n"
"def listaddr(mlist):\n"
"    print(mlist.posting_address)\n"
"\n"
"def requestaddr(mlist):\n"
"    print(mlist.request_address)\n"
"\n"
"Metode run menerima setidaknya satu argumen, yaitu objek milis yang akan "
"dioperasikan.\n"
"Argumen tambahan apa pun yang diberikan pada baris perintah akan diteruskan "
"sebagai\n"
"argumen posisi ke callable.\n"
"\n"
"Jika -l tidak diberikan maka Anda dapat menjalankan fungsi yang tidak "
"menerima argumen.\n"

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:186
msgid ""
"You can print the list's posting address by running the following from the\n"
"command line:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist -r listaddr -l ant@example.com\n"
"Importing listaddr ...\n"
"Running listaddr.listaddr() ...\n"
"ant@example.com"
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mencetak alamat posting milis dengan menjalankan perintah berikut "
"dari\n"
"baris perintah:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist -r listaddr -l [ant@example.com](mailto:ant@example.com)\n"
"Mengimpor listaddr ...\n"
"Menjalankan listaddr.listaddr() ...\n"
"[ant@example.com](mailto:ant@example.com)"

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:195
msgid ""
"And you can print the list's request address by running:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist -r listaddr.requestaddr -l ant@example.com\n"
"Importing listaddr ...\n"
"Running listaddr.requestaddr() ...\n"
"ant-request@example.com"
msgstr ""
"Dan Anda dapat mencetak alamat permintaan milis dengan menjalankan:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist -r listaddr.requestaddr -l [ant@example.com]"
"(mailto:ant@example.com)\n"
"Mengimpor listaddr ...\n"
"Menjalankan listaddr.requestaddr() ...\n"
"[ant-request@example.com](mailto:ant-request@example.com)"

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:203
msgid ""
"As another example, say you wanted to change the display name for a particular\n"
"mailing list.  You could put the following function in a file called\n"
"`change.py`:\n"
"\n"
"def change(mlist, display_name):\n"
"    mlist.display_name = display_name\n"
"\n"
"and run this from the command line:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist -r change -l ant@example.com 'My List'\n"
"\n"
"Note that you do not have to explicitly commit any database transactions, as\n"
"Mailman will do this for you (assuming no errors occured)."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh lain, misalkan Anda ingin mengubah nama tampilan untuk milis "
"tertentu.\n"
"Anda dapat menaruh fungsi berikut dalam file bernama\n"
"`change.py`:\n"
"\n"
"def change(mlist, display_name):\n"
"    mlist.display_name = display_name\n"
"\n"
"dan menjalankan ini dari baris perintah:\n"
"\n"
"% mailman withlist -r change -l [ant@example.com](mailto:ant@example.com) "
"'My List'\n"
"\n"
"Perhatikan bahwa Anda tidak perlu melakukan commit transaksi basis data "
"secara eksplisit, karena\n"
"Mailman akan melakukannya untuk Anda (dengan asumsi tidak terjadi kesalahan)."

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:222
msgid ""
"    Operate on a mailing list.\n"
"\n"
"    For detailed help, see --details\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    Beroperasi di milis.\n"
"\n"
"    Untuk bantuan lebih lanjut, lihat --details\n"
"    "

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:230
msgid ""
"    Leaves you at an interactive prompt after all other processing is complete.\n"
"    This is the default unless the --run option is given."
msgstr ""
"    Membiarkan Anda berada pada prompt interaktif setelah semua pemrosesan "
"lain selesai.\n"
"    Ini adalah default kecuali opsi --run diberikan."

#: src/mailman/commands/cli_withlist.py:235
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Run a script.  The argument is the module path to a callable.  This\n"
"    callable will be imported and then, if --listspec/-l is also given, is\n"
"    called with the mailing list as the first argument.  If additional\n"
"    arguments are given at the end of the command line, they are passed as\n"
"    subsequent positional arguments to the callable.  For additional help, see\n"
"    --details.\n"
"\n"
"    If no --listspec/-l argument is given, the script function being called is\n"
"    called with no arguments.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Jalankan sebuah skrip. Argumennya adalah path modul ke sebuah callable. "
"Callable\n"
"    ini akan diimpor dan kemudian, jika --listspec/-l juga diberikan, akan\n"
"    dipanggil dengan milis sebagai argumen pertama. Jika ada argumen "
"tambahan\n"
"    yang diberikan di akhir baris perintah, argumen tersebut diteruskan "
"sebagai\n"
"    argumen posisi berikutnya ke callable. Untuk bantuan tambahan, lihat\n"
"    --details.\n"
"\n"
"    Jika tidak ada argumen --listspec/-l yang diberikan, fungsi skrip yang "
"dipanggil\n"
"    dipanggil tanpa argumen.\n"
"    "

